(
    title: "Chopper Command",
    description: Some("Defender takes to the desert: you fly a helicopter over scrolling dunes shielding a truck convoy from waves of enemy choppers and jets, with a Long Range Scanner tracking threats beyond the screen edge. Helicopters score 100, jets 200, and every truck still rolling at a waves end pays a bonus; Activision mailed a Chopper Commandos patch to anyone photographing 10,000 points. Abroad it wore many names — Ariolasofts Captain Helicopter in Germany, pirate carts as Pyramid War and Wüstenschlacht."),
